    "acceptance-fire-patterns": {
      "_why": [
        "R6 (team summary spec 5): span = last - first + interval (v1 5m, v2 12h); ratio =",
        "rows / (span / interval) on Grafana; API uses rows per 24h of span. Priority",
        "flapping -> spamming -> stuck. No other core rule matches any row here.",
        "(a) f-a-stuck: every 5m 08-21 00:00..08-24 00:00 = 865 rows (288/288/288/1). Span",
        "72h05m, ratio 1.0, no clear => stuck.",
        "(b) f-b-short: every 5m 08-21 00:00..08-23 23:00 = 853 rows (288/288/277). Span",
        "71h05m < 72h => none.",
        "(c) f-c-dup: two defs, one key, the same 288 ticks on 08-20 = 576 rows. Span 24h =",
        "288 intervals, ratio exactly 2.0 => spamming (inclusive).",
        "(c2) f-c2-offset: the same two defs offset 2.5m on 08-19 = 576 rows. Span 24h02m30s",
        "= 288.5 intervals, ratio 576/288.5 = 1.9965 => none. Interleaving gives 2n/(n+1),",
        "which never reaches 2.0.",
        "(d) f-d-flap: fire 00:00/10:00/20:00, clear 00:05/10:05/20:05 on 08-24 = 6 rows.",
        "Clear rows 20h apart => 3 cycles in a rolling 24h => flapping. Ratio 6/242.",
        "(e) f-e-spread: clears at 08-22 18:05, 08-23 07:05, 08-23 20:05 (26h first to last),",
        "6 rows (2 on 08-22, 4 on 08-23). Max 2 cycles in any [t, t+24h) => none.",
        "(f) f-f-api24: API, hourly 00:00..22:00 + 23:55 on 08-22 = 24 rows, span exactly 24h",
        "=> 24 per 24h, span >= 6h => spamming (inclusive).",
        "(g) f-g-api23: API, hourly 00:00..21:00 + 23:55 on 08-22 = 23 rows, span 24h => 23",
        "per 24h => none.",
        "(h) v2 f-h-flap: firing 08-21 12:00; resolved 08-23 02:00, firing 06:00, resolved",
        "08:00, firing 12:00, resolved 14:00 = 6 rows (1 on 08-21, 5 on 08-23). Three clears",
        "in 12h => flapping. Span 62h, ratio 6/(62/12) = 1.16, so flapping is the only",
        "pattern that can match.",
        "R6 is on EVERY row of a matching identity. v1 R6 rows by date: 08-20 576 (c);",
        "08-21 288 (a); 08-22 288 (a) + 24 (f) = 312 over 2 identities; 08-23 288 (a);",
        "08-24 1 (a) + 6 (d) = 7 over 2 identities. Total 865+576+6+24 = 1471.",
        "v1 rows by date: 08-19 576; 08-20 576; 08-21 288+288 = 576; 08-22 288+288+2+24+23",
        "= 625; 08-23 288+277+4 = 569; 08-24 1+6 = 7. Total 2929.",
        "v1 distinct by date: 1, 1, 2 (a,b), 5 (a,b,e,f,g), 3 (a,b,e), 2 (a,d) => 14/7 = 2.",
        "Model: b, c2, e, g (4 identities) are assessed_good. Per date: 08-19 c2; 08-21 b;",
        "08-22 b,e,g; 08-23 b,e => 1+1+3+2 = 7. Batches: b, c2, e share the v1 rule URL",
        "(one group of 3); g is API with no URL => application group of 1.",
        "One node_name per object, so node and key operands equal distinct per date.",
        "v2 (h) is ready (high, good impact and runbook) => readiness 100%. Both schemas",
        "present => phase_1. Existing acceptance teams stay R6-free: their identities have",
        "at most 3 rows over at most 24h05m, below every threshold, and no clear rows."
      ],
      "phase_derived": "phase_1",
